Subject: [PATCH 1/2] local: rustc 1.85 decode port and DnBOX core-load tracing

Keep the box's existing tracked edits so they are not lost: rewrite two
if-let guards in decode_any for rustc 1.85, and add optional FM1_CORE_LOAD
slice tracing (read-only, no timing change) with a CSV dump at shot end.
